  "description": "At the start of the summer monsoon season and after serving nearly six years for a failed murder attempt, Seoha is released and finds refuge at Maison de Menthe, thanks to an old prison acquaintance, Choi Minyeong. But soon, a man unexpectedly enters Seoha’s life—the very neighbor Minyeong warned him about.\n\n*\"There's a lunatic living next door... He's a creepy perv who's always trying to get me to sleep with him.\"*\n\nBlunt and unapologetic in his desires, the man becomes Seoha’s one escape from a past filled with nightmares—the only thing that makes her feel alive again.\n\n*\"Why don't we keep hooking up, then?\"\n\"Why?\"\n\"They say people only realize that they're alive when they feel the warmth of another...\"\n\"...\"\n\"Cause I'm trying to keep you alive, pretty girl.\"\n\"Fine...\"*\n\nLittle by little, the emptiness in Seoha’s life begins to be filled with Kwon Yiheon. But there's something fishy about this man…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
